          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "description": "Workspace is the directory under ~/claude of the message's cwd; the Manager's own directory is 'manager', anything outside ~/claude 'other'. Days are UTC."
